          :math:`W_{out} = W_{in} + \text{padding\_left} + \text{padding\_right}`

    Examples::

        >>> # xdoctest: +IGNORE_WANT("not sure why xdoctest is choking on this")
        >>> m = nn.ReflectionPad2d(2)
        >>> input = torch.arange(9, dtype=torch.float).reshape(1, 1, 3, 3)
